, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le18ob03re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Requesting and Replying to Information"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Manager</span>: I need you to fill out this form for me.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: Certainly."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you need to ask a stranger for work information, you use expressions like <span class=\"italic\">Excuse me\u2026</span> or <span class=\"italic\">Sorry\u2026</span> to get their attention.<br/><br/>  When you provide information to a stranger about your place of work, you can reply with an offer of help like <span class=\"italic\">How can I help you?</span>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Requesting Information\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Providing Information\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I need you to fill out this form for me.<br/> Is your schedule flexible?<br/> Do you have any questions about the job?<br/>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Certainly. <br/> Cooking is my passion.<br/> Yes\u2026<br/> You need to deal with pressure.<br/> The sous-chef reports to the chef.<br/>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": " <span class=\"italic\">I need you to help me to cook this food. </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "The verb \"need\" is used when making a request. We use the pattern \"need someone to do something\". "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to report to"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to answer to a superior at work"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The sous-chef reports to the chef."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le18ob03aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use in a conversation about a job application."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "pressure "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "stress; demands"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There is a lot of pressure on the sous-chef at dinner time."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le18ob03aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to deal with"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to take actions in order to solve a problem"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You need to be able to deal with pressure."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le18ob03aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to prep"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to prepare dishes and ingredients in a restaurant"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The line cook preps the ingredients."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le18ob03aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to improvise"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to achieve something without preparation"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The sous-chef needs to be able to improvise sometimes."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le18ob03aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "flexible"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "not fixed; able to change"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Is your schedule flexible?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le18ob03aud02"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "You are a restaurant manager."}, {"type": "text", "content": "An applicant comes in to inquire about a job position in your restaurant."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a dialogue (8-10 lines) about the situation."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Describe what the job is about and what the applicant needs to do."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Change roles with your partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write a dialogue between a manager and a potential applicant."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about jobs and work."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I ask specific questions about work to get information."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I convey information to a potential applicant."}]}], "type": "sena"}